        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{E_{1} A_{1}}{E_{1} A_{1} + E_{2} A_{2}} P$</choice_text>
          <commentary>길이를 반영하지 않았다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{E_{2} A_{2}}{E_{1} A_{1} + E_{2} A_{2}} P$</choice_text>
          <commentary>길이를 반영하지 않았다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
